<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ page.headline }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f7f6f2;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --surface-2: #f1f0eb;
    --ink: #171717;
    --muted: #5f5f5a;
    --faint: #8d8b84;
    --line: #dfddd4;
    --serif: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    --shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(29, 27, 22, .08);
  }
  .theme-tech { --accent: #3156d4; --accent-ink: #18368f; --accent-soft: #edf2ff; --accent-warm: #c85d2c; }
  .theme-show { --accent: #a21caf; --accent-ink: #75107d; --accent-soft: #fbecff; --accent-warm: #cf6f18; }
  .theme-sports { --accent: #087f5b; --accent-ink: #045d43; --accent-soft: #e8f7f1; --accent-warm: #b84f2b; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { color: inherit; }
  .topline {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .74);
  }
  .topline-inner {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .page {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px 72px;
  }
  .hero {
    padding: 34px 0 28px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.55fr) minmax(300px, .85fr);
    gap: 30px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, .04);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(35px, 6vw, 62px);
    line-height: 1.01;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    margin: 18px 0 16px;
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .dek {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .summary {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #30302c;
  }
  .hero-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    min-height: 100%;
  }
  .hero-img {
    margin: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .hero-img img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .hero-img figcaption {
    padding: 8px 12px 10px;
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .scoreboard {
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .score-title {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .score-item {
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .score-item:first-of-type { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  .score-item b {
    display: block;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .score-item span { display: block; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.42; }
  .lede-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin: 8px 0 24px;
  }
  .lede-fact {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 18px;
    min-height: 128px;
  }
  .lede-fact .kicker {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 760;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .lede-fact p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.24;
  }
  section {
    margin-top: 42px;
  }
  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .section-note {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-left: auto;
  }
  .fact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .fact {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 15px 16px;
  }
  .fact .label {
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  .fact .value { color: #292925; font-size: 15px; }
  .timeline {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .timeline li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 108px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--line);
    padding: 13px 16px 13px 12px;
  }
  .timeline li.upcoming {
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .tl-date {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 760;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .tl-label { font-weight: 720; }
  .tl-desc { margin: 3px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .entity-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .entity {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 12px 13px;
  }
  .entity b { display: block; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .entity span { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.35; }
  .category-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, .45fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .category-intro {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 18px;
  }
  .category-intro h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 19px; }
  .category-intro p { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); font-size: 14px; }
  .detail-panel {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .kv {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr;
    gap: 9px 14px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .kv dt {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 720;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .kv dd { margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; }
  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .chip {
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.04);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .matches {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .matches th {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: left;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .matches td {
    padding: 10px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .reaction-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .reaction {
    margin: 0;
    background: #fff8ef;
    border: 1px solid #ead9c5;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-warm);
    padding: 15px 16px;
  }
  .reaction p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; }
  .reaction cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .fact-board-late {
    margin-top: 54px;
  }
  .context-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(260px, .9fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .why {
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 20px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .next {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 16px 18px 16px 36px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .next li { margin-bottom: 9px; }
  .source-method {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .sources {
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 30px;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 22px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .sources li {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    padding-left: 3px;
  }
  .sources a { color: var(--accent-ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .src-meta {
    display: block;
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .freshness {
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .cite {
    vertical-align: super;
    line-height: 0;
    margin-left: 2px;
  }
  .cite a {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 760;
    text-decoration: none;
    opacity: .62;
  }
  .cite a:hover { opacity: 1; text-decoration: underline; }
  footer {
    margin-top: 44px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .hero, .category-block, .context-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .lede-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sources { columns: 1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .page { padding: 0 16px 54px; }
    .topline-inner { padding: 9px 16px; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
    .hero { padding-top: 24px; }
    .timeline li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
    .kv { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
{% macro cite(ids) %}
{%- if ids -%}
<sup class="cite">{% for i in ids %}<a href="#src-{{ i }}" aria-label="Source {{ i }}">{{ i }}</a>{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}</sup>
{%- endif -%}
{% endmacro %}
<body class="theme-{{ page.category }}">
<div class="topline">
  <div class="topline-inner">
    <span>Topic page generated {{ page.generated_at | fmt_date }}</span>
    <span>{{ page.sources | length }} fetched sources cited</span>
  </div>
</div>

<main class="page">
  <header class="hero">
    <div>
      <span class="label">
        {% if page.category == "tech" %}Tech signal
        {% elif page.category == "show" %}Culture tracker
        {% else %}Sports tracker{% endif %}
      </span>
      <h1>{{ page.headline }}</h1>
      <p class="dek">{{ page.dek }}</p>
      <p class="summary">{{ page.summary }}</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-card" aria-label="Most important signals">
      {% if page.hero_image %}
      <figure class="hero-img">
        <img src="{{ page.hero_image.url }}" alt="{{ page.hero_image.caption or page.headline }}"
             loading="lazy" onerror="this.parentElement.style.display='none'">
        {% if page.hero_image.caption %}
        <figcaption>{{ page.hero_image.caption }}{% if page.hero_image.credit_source_id %}{{ cite([page.hero_image.credit_source_id]) }}{% endif %}</figcaption>
        {% endif %}
      </figure>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="scoreboard">
        <div class="score-title">Lead signals</div>
        {% for f in page.key_facts[:3] %}
        <div class="score-item">
          <b>{{ f.label }}</b>
          <span>{{ f.value }}{{ cite(f.source_ids) }}</span>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </aside>
  </header>

  <div class="lede-strip" aria-label="Lead facts">
    {% for f in page.key_facts[3:6] %}
    <article class="lede-fact">
      <div class="kicker">{{ f.label }}</div>
      <p>{{ f.value }}{{ cite(f.source_ids) }}</p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% if page.reactions %}
  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Reaction layer</h2>
      <span class="section-note">What made the story travel</span>
    </div>
    <div class="reaction-grid">
      {% for r in page.reactions[:6] %}
      <blockquote class="reaction">
        <p>{{ r.take }}{{ cite(r.source_ids) }}</p>
        <cite>{{ r.source }}</cite>
      </blockquote>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Timeline</h2>
      <span class="section-note">Past and upcoming moments</span>
    </div>
    <ol class="timeline">
      {% for t in page.timeline %}
      <li class="{{ t.status }}">
        <div class="tl-date">{{ t.date | fmt_date }}{% if t.status == "upcoming" %} / Upcoming{% endif %}</div>
        <div>
          <div class="tl-label">{{ t.label }}{{ cite(t.source_ids) }}</div>
          {% if t.description %}<p class="tl-desc">{{ t.description }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>

  {% if page.entities %}
  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>People and stakes</h2>
      <span class="section-note">Entities the page is tracking</span>
    </div>
    <div class="entity-grid">
      {% for e in page.entities %}
      <article class="entity">
        <b>{{ e.name }}</b>
        <span>{{ e.role }}{% if e.description %} - {{ e.description }}{% endif %}</span>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% set x = page.extras %}
  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      {% if page.category == "tech" %}<h2>Rollout details</h2>
      {% elif page.category == "show" %}<h2>Event details</h2>
      {% else %}<h2>Tournament details</h2>{% endif %}
      <span class="section-note">Category-specific schema block</span>
    </div>
    <div class="category-block">
      <div class="category-intro">
        {% if page.category == "tech" %}
        <h3>Availability and proof points</h3>
        <p>Tech pages emphasize rollout status, ownership, and measurable specs.</p>
        {% elif page.category == "show" %}
        <h3>Logistics and outcome</h3>
        <p>Culture pages emphasize venue, dates, participants, results, and viewing context.</p>
        {% else %}
        <h3>Format and scoreboard</h3>
        <p>Sports pages emphasize structure, match state, results, and what comes next.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="detail-panel">
        {% if page.category == "tech" %}
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>Product</dt><dd>{{ x.product }}</dd>
          <dt>Company</dt><dd>{{ x.company }}</dd>
          <dt>Availability</dt><dd>{{ x.rollout_status }}</dd>
          {% for b in x.benchmarks_or_specs %}
          <dt>{{ b.label }}</dt><dd>{{ b.value }}{{ cite(b.source_ids) }}</dd>
          {% endfor %}
        </dl>
        {% elif page.category == "show" %}
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>Venue</dt><dd>{{ x.venue }}</dd>
          <dt>Dates</dt><dd>{{ x.dates }}</dd>
          {% if x.results %}<dt>Result</dt><dd>{{ x.results }}</dd>{% endif %}
          {% if x.how_to_watch %}<dt>How to watch</dt><dd>{{ x.how_to_watch }}</dd>{% endif %}
        </dl>
        {% if x.lineup_or_participants %}
        <div class="chips">
          {% for p in x.lineup_or_participants %}<span class="chip">{{ p }}</span>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% else %}
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>Format</dt><dd>{{ x.format_summary }}</dd>
          {% if x.standings_or_results %}<dt>So far</dt><dd>{{ x.standings_or_results }}</dd>{% endif %}
          {% if x.how_to_watch %}<dt>How to watch</dt><dd>{{ x.how_to_watch }}</dd>{% endif %}
        </dl>
        {% if x.key_matches %}
        <table class="matches">
          <thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Match</th><th>Venue</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for m in x.key_matches %}
            <tr>
              <td>{{ m.date | fmt_date }}</td>
              <td>{{ m.teams }}</td>
              <td>{{ m.venue or "-" }}</td>
              <td>{{ m.result or "-" }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Context and next moves</h2>
      <span class="section-note">Reader value beyond the headline</span>
    </div>
    <div class="context-grid">
      <div class="why">{{ page.why_it_matters }}</div>
      {% if page.whats_next %}
      <ol class="next">
        {% for n in page.whats_next %}<li>{{ n }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ol>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fact-board-late">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Full fact board</h2>
      <span class="section-note">Complete source-linked facts</span>
    </div>
    <div class="fact-grid">
      {% for f in page.key_facts %}
      <article class="fact">
        <div class="label">{{ f.label }}</div>
        <div class="value">{{ f.value }}{{ cite(f.source_ids) }}</div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Sources</h2>
      <span class="section-note">Live web, fetched pages, extracted text</span>
    </div>
    <div class="source-method">
      Sourcing method: the pipeline queries Brave Search, fetches candidate URLs,
      extracts article text with trafilatura, clips the evidence pack, and asks the
      model to cite source IDs from that pack. This is source-linked retrieval, not
      a vector-database RAG index.
    </div>
    <ol class="sources">
      {% for s in page.sources %}
      <li id="src-{{ s.id }}">
        <a href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ s.title or s.url }}</a>
        <span class="src-meta">{{ s.sitename or (s.url | domain) }}{% if s.date %} / {{ s.date | fmt_date }}{% endif %}</span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    {% if page.freshness_note %}
    <div class="freshness">{{ page.freshness_note }}</div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <footer>
    Generated from: "{{ page.input_sentence }}" / schema v{{ page.schema_version }}
  </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
